{"game": "remnant-2", "language": "english", "appid": 1282100, "month": "2024-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1722470400, "end_date": 1723075199, "month_true_total": 518, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-12 14:55:24 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "171646238", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095430345", "personaname": "Ferus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198095430345/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 19017, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12004, "last_played": 1755287671, "avatar": "2141b1430f57a3d4d073c19b0dd97992bbce40d4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game Good", "timestamp_created": 1723070709, "timestamp_updated": 1723070709, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171642886", "author": {"steamid": "76561198015263981", "personaname": "Kaz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Kazyyk/", "num_games_owned": 725, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 3138, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1357, "last_played": 1760196641, "avatar": "b1df8080c2d4f9aa1621f77a2d5eed86d1e6a0e8"}, "language": "english", "review": "I enjoy these types of games. If you enjoy a bit of randomization and variety in your adventures, hunting secrets, gradual power creep, and third-person shooting, then perhaps you will too. I think they did a great job with most of the voice work, and while the writing seems a little underdeveloped in some cases, there's enough interesting lore and engaging gameplay to keep me satisfied. I think it's an improvement on the first game, I just wish they would add an accessibility option to dim or darken the flashbang that occurs when resting at a checkpoint. While I would enjoy a Remnant 3, I don't know where they could go with the story. Perhaps they could explore [spoiler]the nature of The Labyrinth and it's relationship to the other worlds.[/spoiler]", "timestamp_created": 1723066475, "timestamp_updated": 1723066475, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.517502367496490479", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171638635", "author": {"steamid": "76561198820964518", "personaname": "Furious-Ancler", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198820964518/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 4177, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2293, "last_played": 1769288471, "avatar": "cb801bef63c57eca8dcca551d6827e3b86d15623"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun game, great to team kill xx\r\nGood boss fights and fun weapons.", "timestamp_created": 1723061286, "timestamp_updated": 1723061286, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171637727", "author": {"steamid": "76561197991270548", "personaname": "Jason", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nullxvoid89/", "num_games_owned": 476, "num_reviews": 114, "playtime_forever": 1056, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 292, "last_played": 1732494811, "avatar": "4f08875defca8aff49afb69df391e9fc63671ae5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best Rpg/Shooter ive played so far, guns have impact and enemies and atmosphere/graphics are as good as any horror game like dead space. This is what I imagined wanting Hellgate London to be back in the day.", "timestamp_created": 1723060383, "timestamp_updated": 1723060383, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171634525", "author": {"steamid": "76561198038142191", "personaname": "Egerod", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198038142191/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 775, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 489, "last_played": 1726501523, "avatar": "90e0366b40d637c72ea2ef68fe70b58197faf2d0"}, "language": "english", "review": "The combat is fun and reward, but the game as a bad habit of swarming you with \"random encounter\" enemies, which quickly gets boring.\nThis gets even worse with the sparse amount of checkpoints, distance to some bosses and inability to always just \"run past\" enemies to bosses, causes every failed boss attempt to be a significant time loss as you have to clear all the way backup to the boss.\n\nSo while I really want to enjoy the game, it doesn't respect my time, and what could have been a fun challenge with some bosses, becomes an annoying grind as I have to repeatedly clear up to the boss over an over again.", "timestamp_created": 1723056868, "timestamp_updated": 1723056868, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.48178216814994812", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}]}